Yeah. Yeah, uh, my mom
asked me to get it for her.

244
00:10:55,463 --> 00:10:57,829
Oh, wow,
what a nice kid you are,

245
00:10:57,949 --> 00:10:59,766
Going shopping for your mom
on Halloween,

246
00:10:59,886 --> 00:11:02,613
