364
00:16:53,022 --> 00:16:55,933
Aah! Get it off of me!
Get it off me!

365
00:16:56,053 --> 00:16:58,386
It's trying to fly in my hair!
Aah! Aah! Oh, my God!

366
00:16:58,506 --> 00:17:00,018
Aah! Aah! Get it off me!
No, no, get it off me!

367
