390
00:17:57,543 --> 00:17:59,659
I just thought
that for one Halloween,

391
00:17:59,779 --> 00:18:03,014
we didn't have to do the same
old thing... Sitting on the couch,

392
00:18:03,048 --> 00:18:05,543
