Go! Have fun.

403
00:18:29,543 --> 00:18:32,543
<i>I wanna have fun with you, Mike!</i>

404
00:18:33,099 --> 00:18:36,716
You should be happy. 17 years.
I still want to have fun with you.

405
00:18:43,557 --> 00:18:46,059
